{
  "name": "loop-length-tools",
  "about": "finish_reason=length 与工具调用同时出现时的走向（agent/loop/AgentLoop.ts）以及大文件写入修复（agent/loop/LargeFileRepair.ts）。l1：纯文本被截断 → 续写提示（1823-1840）→ 续写时模型改发工具调用，执行后计数清零（2185）再正常结束；l2：文本 + 参数完整的 read_file + length → 不进恢复，照常执行（1951 toolContext.outputTruncated）；l3：write_file 缺 content + length → 工具报 required → 写入前修复提示 Recovery attempt 1/5，剥掉出错的一对消息（LargeFileRepair.ts:222-240、tryPreDraft）→ 模型补全后写出；l4：write_file 参数被 jsonrepair 补全（finish=tool_calls）→ 不执行，按大文件截断恢复（AgentLoop.ts:1169-1187、recoverFromRepairedTruncation）；l5：先写出文件，再一次 edit_file 失败且 length → 写入后修复提示 Post-draft recovery attempt 1/5（hasPostDraftRisk）；l6：write_file 一直缺 content → 写入前修复 5 次用尽后停止（tryPreDraft stop）；l7：Anthropic 形状 stop_reason=max_tokens 的纯文本 → 续写。 已知不稳：Anthropic 会话第二次请求的 cachePlan.fingerprint 基线自比就不同（与 proto-anthropic-basic 相同），声明为 volatile。",
  "volatile": [
    "/chats/s-l7\\.jsonl\\.jsonl\\[\\d+\\]\\.request\\.cachePlan\\.fingerprint$"
  ],
  "config": "schemaVersion: 1\nagent:\n  model: bbx/deterministic\n  maxContextTokens: 65536\n  maxOutputTokens: 8192\nmodel:\n  providers:\n    bbx:\n      protocol: openai\n      url: {MOCK}/v1\n      apiKey: bbx-mock-only\n      models:\n        deterministic:\n          capabilities:\n            supportsToolUse: true\n            maxContextTokens: 65536\n            maxOutputTokens: 8192\n    anth:\n      protocol: anthropic\n      url: {MOCK}\n      apiKey: bbx-anthropic-key\n      models:\n        claude-bbx:\n          capabilities:\n            supportsToolUse: true\n            maxContextTokens: 65536\n            maxOutputTokens: 8192\ntelemetry:\n  enabled: false\n",
  "files": {
    "home/.pilotdeck/a.txt": "alpha\n"
  },
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\":\"Length\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l1-done",
      "when": [
        "l1:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_l1\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "l1 done."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l1-resumed",
      "when": [
        "l1:",
        "Pick up mid-sentence"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "and then ",
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_l1",
          "name": "read_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "a.txt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l1",
      "when": [
        "l1:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Part one ",
        "finish": "length"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l2-done",
      "when": [
        "l2:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_l2\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "l2 done."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l2",
      "when": [
        "l2:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Reading.",
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_l2",
          "name": "read_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "a.txt"
          }
        },
        "finish": "length"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l3-done",
      "when": [
        "l3:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_l3b\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "l3 done."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l3-repair",
      "when": [
        "l3:",
        "Recovery attempt 1/5"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_l3b",
          "name": "write_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "big3.html",
            "content": "<html></html>\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l3",
      "when": [
        "l3:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_l3a",
          "name": "write_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "big3.html"
          }
        },
        "finish": "length"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l4-done",
      "when": [
        "l4:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_l4b\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "l4 done."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l4-repair",
      "when": [
        "l4:",
        "Recovery attempt 1/5"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_l4b",
          "name": "write_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "big4.html",
            "content": "<html></html>\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l4",
      "when": [
        "l4:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_l4a",
          "name": "write_file",
          "rawArguments": "{\"file_path\": \"big4.html\", \"content\": \"<html><body>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l5-done",
      "when": [
        "l5:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_l5c\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "l5 done."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l5-repair",
      "when": [
        "l5:",
        "Post-draft recovery attempt 1/5"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_l5c",
          "name": "edit_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "big5.html",
            "old_string": "<body>",
            "new_string": "<body><p>x</p>"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l5-edit",
      "when": [
        "l5:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_l5a\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_l5b",
          "name": "edit_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "big5.html",
            "old_string": "<nope>",
            "new_string": "x"
          }
        },
        "finish": "length"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l5",
      "when": [
        "l5:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_l5a",
          "name": "write_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "big5.html",
            "content": "<html><body></body></html>\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l6",
      "when": [
        "l6:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_l6",
          "name": "write_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "big6.html"
          }
        },
        "finish": "length"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l7-resumed",
      "when": [
        "l7:",
        "Pick up mid-sentence"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "and part two."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l7",
      "when": [
        "l7:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Part one ",
        "finish": "max_tokens"
      }
    }
  ],
